    "synopsis": "\"Ethan Lang‌'s stepmother, ‌Mia Clarkson‌, was being pursued by her boss ‌Leo Knight‌. To avoid offending him, Mia asked her son ‌Ethan‌ to pretend to be her boyfriend, hoping Leo would lose interest.\nHowever, ‌Leo‌, unwilling to give up, ‌manipulated Sophia Cole‌ to sabotage Mia and Ethan's fake relationship. A series of ‌misunderstandings‌ led to ‌provocative encounters‌, and eventually, the act became real. Ethan and Mia ‌transgressed moral boundaries‌, evolving from mother and son into lovers.\"",
